    "description": "Paella is a classic Spanish dish featuring saffron rice with chorizo, chicken, and seafood. However, this easy paella recipe is totally customizable, so feel free make it your own with mussels, scallops, or calamari. The beauty of paella is that all the flavors build upon one another as the dish comes together in one pan. Plus, it’s an affordable way to feed a lot of people, which makes it perfect for summer entertaining. There’s nothing like the signature combination of creamy rice, savory meat, and that fresh burst from the seafood and lemon. Make this rice dish for dinner with friends and family soon!",
